The scientific method is:
1)=A0 Formulate a question. In this case, I believe the question is "What a=
re the cause(s), if any, that make Lojban more prone to listener error in n=
oisy environments?"
2) Make a hypothesis. "The high similarity of the various cmavo series, suc=
h as for example [so'a, so'e, so'i, so'o, so'u], make Lojban more error pro=
